| ISMRM(RD) | Int. Society for Magnetic Resonance in Medicine (Raw Data format) | | [[Software]] |
| LNA | low-noise amplifier | coil preamplifier | [[B5]] |
| MB | multiband | = SMS | [[H3]] |
| MoDL | model-based deep learning | unrolled DL recon | [[J5]] |
| MPRAGE | magnetization-prepared rapid gradient echo | 3D IR-prepared $T_1$w | [[H2]] |
| MRA | MR angiography | vessel imaging (TOF, PC, contrast-enhanced) | — |
| MRF | MR fingerprinting | quantitative maps by dictionary matching | — |
| MRS / CSI | MR spectroscopy / chemical-shift imaging | spectra instead of images | — |
| MT | magnetization transfer | | [[D2]] |
| NEX / NSA | number of excitations / signals averaged | averages | [[G2]] |
| NMR | nuclear magnetic resonance | the physics MRI is built on | [[A1]] |
| NSF | nephrogenic systemic fibrosis | rare Gd-related disease in kidney failure | [[B6]] |
| PC | phase contrast | flow velocity in the phase | — |
| PD | proton density | | [[D1]] |
| PE | phase encoding | | [[F1]] |
| PF | partial Fourier | | [[H3]] |
| PI | parallel imaging | | [[H3]] |
| PNS | peripheral nerve stimulation | $dB/dt$ limit | [[B4]] |
