| pTx | parallel transmission | several independent transmit channels | [[J1]] |
| QSM | quantitative susceptibility mapping | $\chi$ from phase | — |
| RARE | Rapid Acquisition with Relaxation Enhancement | original name of FSE/TSE | [[H2]] |
| RF | radiofrequency | | [[B1]] |
